Subject: Cantor Engine Neural Fabric and CLI Build Exploded Specification

Description: Seven-fold, inward-depth, cross-woven build specification for the provider-independent Cantor semantic coprocessor, its deterministic proof-carrying semantic fabric, its gated learned routing layer, and its CLI and Codex tool surfaces.

